HEAD: 2b71edd5350c3aa2450874a96d831423e6400ee2 (feature/editor-ux); working tree = the T46 commit's changes (new layout baselines, narrower preview mask, workflow, integration gate, docs)
Image: mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:v1.63.0-noble (linux/arm64 on Docker Desktop, VM CPUs per `docker info`: see below); @playwright/test 1.63.0
Node in the image: v24.20.0 (repo wants >=22.18 <23: pnpm warns; the nightly workflow's setup-node installs 22 from .nvmrc); pnpm 10.25.0 via corepack
How: repo copied (no node_modules/.git/.env) into the container, `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`, `pnpm exec prisma generate`, then `CI=1 pnpm test:e2e [--workers=N]` inside the container.
  Docker socket mounted from the host (-v /var/run/docker.sock), static Docker CLI 27.3.1 installed in the container, TESTCONTAINERS_HOST_OVERRIDE=host.docker.internal
  (--add-host=host.docker.internal:host-gateway), TESTCONTAINERS_RYUK_DISABLED=true (local only; the nightly workflow keeps Ryuk). The app server and its throwaway Postgres
  container come from playwright.config.ts's webServer (start-app-server.mjs). .env = env.example with generated secrets and a dummy Sentry DSN; never the repo's .env databases.
  docker run --ipc=host --init --add-host=host.docker.internal:host-gateway -e TESTCONTAINERS_HOST_OVERRIDE=host.docker.internal -e TESTCONTAINERS_RYUK_DISABLED=true \
    -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock -v <repo copy>:/src:ro mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:v1.63.0-noble bash /run.sh
Docker VM: 10 CPUs, 8319504384 bytes memory

